        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "彼の直な人柄は、誰からも好かれる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "嘘がつけない直な性格なので、彼の言葉はいつも信頼できる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼女の直な反応に、思わず笑ってしまった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "easygoing",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "彼は直な性格で、あまり細かいことを気にしない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "もっと直に構えれば、人生は楽になるだろう。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "あの人は本当に直な人で、いつも笑顔を絶やさない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "gloss": "night duty",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
